{#
  BeMart admin Plugin list — EC-CUBE goPluginList (インストールプラグイン一覧).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Store/plugin.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Store/plugin.twig) together with
  its `plugin_table.twig` include — the user-plugin card markup is
  inlined here.

  Store section, DATA/LIST page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin `default_frame.twig`),
  not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*`
  / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the PluginList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/PluginList.php — body carries `count` +
  `plugins`, a flat list of {pluginCode, pluginName, pluginVersion,
  installed, enabled}).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `{% for Plugin in Plugins %}` -> the resource body's `plugins`
     list. EC-CUBE keys the per-row action `<a>`s / `<form>` by the
     numeric `Plugin.id` (dtb_plugin primary key); the PluginListFetched
     projection does not surface a numeric id, only `pluginCode`, so
     BeMart keys the row + actions by `pluginCode`. Same anchors, same
     classes — only the id param differs.
   - EC-CUBE's `plugin.twig` renders TWO cards: an owners-store card
     (`plugin_table_official.twig` over `officialPlugins`) and a
     user-plugin card (`plugin_table.twig` over `unofficialPlugins`).
     BeMart's PluginListFetched projection carries ONE flat `plugins`
     list with no owners-store `source` distinction (the EC-CUBE.co
     owners-store API is out of scope — see `FakePluginStorage`'s
     INSTALL STUB doc). The owners-store card and its
     `plugin_table_official.twig` markup are OMITTED, not invented; only
     the user-plugin card (`ユーザー独自プラグイン`) is ported.
     Enumerated as residual.
   - `plugin_forms[Plugin.id]` (the per-plugin update-archive upload
     `<form>`) -> NOT carried by the projection; the per-row update
     `<form>`/`{{ form_widget }}` + `アップデート` button are OMITTED
     (the body has no upload form). Enumerated as residual.
   - `Plugin.source` (0 == user plugin) -> the projection carries no
     `source`; the update column is always rendered as the (omitted)
     user-plugin shape.
   - `configPages[Plugin.code]` (per-plugin config-page link) -> the
     projection carries no plugin config-page registry; the cog/設定
     `<a>` is OMITTED. Enumerated as residual.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the enable/disable/delete `<a>` ->
     EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront
     ports omit it. EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_store_plugin' %}
{% set title = 'インストールプラグイン一覧' %}
{% set sub_title = 'オーナーズストア' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        function changeActionSubmit(action, form_name) {
            document.forms[form_name].action = action;
            document.forms[form_name].submit();
            return false;
        }
    </script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block sheetsheet %}
    <style type="text/css">
        table a.plugin-image:hover {
            text-underline: none;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <a href="{{ url('admin_store_plugin_install') }}"
                           class="btn btn-ec-regular me-2 float-end">アップロードして新規追加</a>
                        <h5 class="box-title mb-3">ユーザー独自プラグイン</h5>
                    </div>
                    {% if plugins|length > 0 %}
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                            <table class="table table-sm">
                                <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 ps-3 pt-2 pb-2">プラグイン名</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">バージョン</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">コード</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">状態</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">アップデート</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">&nbsp;</th>
                                </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                {% for Plugin in plugins %}
                                        <tr class="{% if Plugin.enabled == false %}active{% endif %}">
                                            <td class="align-middle ps-3">
                                                {{ Plugin.pluginName }}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">{{ Plugin.pluginVersion }}</td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">{{ Plugin.pluginCode }}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                {% if Plugin.enabled %}
                                                    <span class="text-success">有効</span>
                                                {% else %}
                                                    <span class="text-secondary">無効</span>
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                <div class="col-12 col-xs-11 col-md-12 col-lg-12 float-end text-center">
                                                    <div class="row">
                                                            {% if Plugin.enabled == false %}
                                                            <div class="col-6 px-0">
                                                                <a href="#" class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon"
                                                                   data-bs-toggle="modal"
                                                                   data-bs-target="#localPluginDeleteModal"
                                                                   data-delete-url="{{ url('admin_store_plugin_uninstall', { code: Plugin.pluginCode }) }}">
                                                                    <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="削除"></i>
                                                                </a>
                                                            </div>
                                                            {% endif %}
                                                            {% if Plugin.enabled %}
                                                            <div class="col-6 px-0">
                                                                <form method="post" action="{{ url('admin_store_plugin_disable', { code: Plugin.pluginCode }) }}">
                                                                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token('bemart')) }}">
                                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon" data-confirm="false">
                                                                        <i class="fa fa-pause fa-lg text-secondary" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="無効にする"></i>
                                                                    </button>
                                                                </form>
                                                            </div>
                                                            {% else %}
                                                            <div class="col-6 px-0">
                                                                <form method="post" action="{{ url('admin_store_plugin_enable', { code: Plugin.pluginCode }) }}">
                                                                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token('bemart')) }}">
                                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon" data-confirm="false">
                                                                        <i class="fa fa-play fa-lg text-secondary" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="有効にする"></i>
                                                                    </button>
                                                                </form>
                                                            </div>
                                                            {% endif %}
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="text-danger">
                                ユーザー独自プラグインはインストールされていません。
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal fade" id="localPluginDeleteModal" tabindex="-1"
         role="dialog"
         aria-labelledby="localPluginDeleteModal" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                        プラグインの削除を確認する</h5>
                    <button class="btn-close" type="button"
                            data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                            aria-label="Close">
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body text-start">
                    <p class="text-start">
                        このプラグインを削除してもよろしいですか？</p>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button"
                            data-bs-dismiss="modal">キャンセル
                    </button>
                    <a href="#"
                       class="btn btn-ec-delete"
                       data-confirm="false"
                      >
                        削除
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
